  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-005 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, and Sivir. Version 0.7.5 rebuilds ban/pick splash presentation from the verified Ban/Pick View Plus contract: it rewrites the live card NinePatch render command every frame in post_render instead of resizing stock ImageRunner nodes or relying on static splash siblings. Native question cards, swap-phase state, and champion icons remain untouched below the 284x172 illustration. It also keeps the readable Red Brambleback, Blue Sentinel, and Murk Wolf scale from 0.7.4 with centered bodies, native landing lines, and stable animation timing. The pack includes full-body encyclopedia portraits, image-generated objectives, neutral monsters, towers, Nexus crystals, League-style item art, and locally extracted official Baron audio for Teamfight Manager 2 v0.5.0 Mod API 0.8.",
